<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', padding: '16px 40px 8px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>演示实录 ⑥ · 归因诊断（L5）与主动推送</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8' }}>系统真实运行界面 · 未作修饰</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, padding: '2px 40px 0 40px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Image src="assets/demo6_l5a.png" style={{ width: 694, height: 320, objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
            <Image src="assets/demo6_l5b.png" style={{ width: 346, height: 320, objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ padding: '14px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>这一步在做什么：</span>不只告诉人「你这周学得少」，而是给出<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>归因、推理链与置信度</span>（本例：高频低完成，86%），再把建议落成可执行的下一步；同样的结论还会从通知中心主动推过来——认知简报、教练提示、学习健康报告。
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 140, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '13px 18px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>结论带推理链</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>三条推理依据 + 置信度，人可以判断这条归因站不站得住。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 140, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '13px 18px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>建议要能执行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>不说「要更努力」，而是「先读完 1 条、写 3 行摘要、24 小时内做一次动作」。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 140, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '13px 18px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>采纳即闭环</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>采纳诊断后学习计划随之改写——输出反向改进系统，这是闭环的实例。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 140, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '13px 18px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>它会主动开口</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>定时推送按自然周 / 月幂等去重，重复触发不会重复打扰。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '10px 40px 14px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>认知副驾 · Cognitive Copilot</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>26 / 27</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
